<title>USA: Carolina Power elects Cavanaugh CEO.</title>
<headline>Carolina Power elects Cavanaugh CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina Power &amp; Light Co said on Wednesday the company's board elected William Cavanaugh III as the company's chief executive officer, succeeding Sherwood Smith Jr.</p>
<p>Smith, who will continue to serve as chairman, is stepping down from that post on October 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Cavanaugh has been Carolina Power's president and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Carolina Power said Smith announced his plans for management succession at the company's annual meeting in May.</p>
</text>
